values ('Madloba.info', 'https://madloba.info/en/faq/housing/where-to-stay-in-tbilisi/', false, null, null,
        '2026-10-24T00:00:00Z'::timestamptz, 'en', '"The Old Town is hilly and cobbled, but everything is close by." "Vera and Vake are quieter and greener." "Vake is considered one of the most prestigious residential districts." "Saburtalo suits longer stays, with metro, shops and moderate prices." "Saburtalo and Didube are cheaper with good metro links." Fabrika in Marjanishvili "is lively and full of bars". Checked Oct. 3, 2026.')
on conflict do nothing;
