        '2026-10-24T00:00:00Z'::timestamptz, 'en', '"historic Old Tbilisi, which was built during the early Middle Ages", a compact walkable core with domed 17th century sulphur baths. Mtatsminda Park, the highest point, "a popular playground for locals and visitors alike", linked to the city by funicular.')
on conflict do nothing;
