values ('Georgian National Tourism Administration (georgia.travel)', 'https://georgia.travel/regions/samegrelo-zemo-svaneti', true, null, null,
        '2026-10-24T00:00:00Z'::timestamptz, 'en', 'Zemo Svaneti is "a high-mountain region and hotspot of tourism and alpinism"; Mestia is its centre. Svan towers "standing 20 to 25 meters high". Zugdidi is "the main city of Samegrelo", with the Dadiani palace, now a state museum.')
