values ('Madloba.info', 'https://madloba.info/en/blog/laws-of-georgia/legal-subtleties-of-renting-in-georgia/', false, '2026-03-04', null,
        '2026-10-24T00:00:00Z'::timestamptz, 'en', '"a written rental agreement is not legally required for short-term or household rentals", but a written record is advisable. Lists "Rights to receive and return a deposit" (Civil Code Article 537). "Notarization is needed only in certain situations", such as residence permit applications and registration at a place of residence. Updated Sept. 27, 2026.')
